  "releaseNotes": "Production-hardening release: parser now safely rejects 10 unsupported PDF structures (xref-stream, object-stream, encryption, XFA, rotation, inherited resources, etc.) with fail-closed exceptions. Test suite expanded from 15 to 37 tests with renderability assertions. Production-ready for classic AcroForm PDFs with direct page annotations; comprehensive documentation on supported slice, limitations, and deployment guidance.",
